            "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/danish_koul_14/{size}/197164_2.png",
            "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:25:46.662Z",
            "cooked": "<p>We’re a D2C wellness brand in India selling a digital product with a one-time payment. We get 50–100 customer queries a day on WhatsApp and email, and want an AI agent to handle most of them.</p>\n<p><strong>What we want built</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>An AI agent on WhatsApp Business that answers common questions (product, access, payments, refunds) in Hindi and English, using our FAQ and policy docs</li>\n<li>Order and payment lookup via Razorpay so the agent can confirm purchase status</li>\n<li>Refund requests logged to Google Sheets and routed to our team for approval</li>\n<li>Complex or unhappy conversations escalated to a human in Slack, with the full chat history</li>\n<li>The same agent handles incoming support emails (Gmail), with drafted replies for review</li>\n<li>A weekly report: query volume, top topics, resolution rate, escalations</li>\n</ol>\n<p>We’re open to a phased rollout, starting with steps 1–4.</p>\n<p><strong>What we’re looking for</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Proven n8n experience with AI agents and RAG/knowledge-base setups</li>\n<li>Experience with WhatsApp Business Cloud API</li>\n<li>Clear documentation and handover</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>To apply, please share:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1–2 relevant n8n projects or portfolio links</li>\n<li>Your pricing model (hourly or fixed) and estimated cost for phase 1 and the full build</li>\n<li>Estimated timeline</li>\n<li>Monthly maintenance options</li>\n<li>Expected running costs (AI/API usage, WhatsApp messaging, n8n Cloud vs self-hosted)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Reply here or DM me.</p>\n<hr>",
